        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Etiquette Elegance</i> — a temple of refinement and impeccable service. Tailor the dishes to your guests' tastes, set the tables to perfection, and create an atmosphere of exquisite elegance. But beware: the slightest mistake and perfection will be lost. Can you achieve perfection and become a legend of the gastronomic club?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graceful table setting</strong> – Arrange the cutlery correctly, keep the table in order, and follow all the nuances of restaurant etiquette</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/extras/8cd78cee870aba341613306517cd4ca9.poster.avif?t=1772218347\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/extras/8cd78cee870aba341613306517cd4ca9.webm?t=1772218347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/extras/8cd78cee870aba341613306517cd4ca9.mp4?t=1772218347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absurdly picky guests</strong> – Each visitor has their own tastes, habits, and quirks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/extras/49a61607463f2188b29eff4509ba7c49.avif?t=1772218347\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/extras_big/49a61607463f2188b29eff4509ba7c49.avif?t=1772218347 width=800 height=125 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dishes beyond time and space</strong> – Over 50 menu items created from a variety of ingredients</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/extras/184984a70595ebf4663de0525370d19e.avif?t=1772218347\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/extras_big/184984a70595ebf4663de0525370d19e.avif?t=1772218347 width=800 height=125 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily chaos</strong> – Unexpected challenges make each level special</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/extras/d6ed70063e0dc640c180f715cde0c41c.avif?t=1772218347\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/extras_big/d6ed70063e0dc640c180f715cde0c41c.avif?t=1772218347 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylish retro-futuristic setting</strong> – Immerse yourself in the elegant atmosphere of a classic restaurant of the future</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/extras/972df50e44d010f06d3a91bdf4fee051.avif?t=1772218347\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/extras_big/972df50e44d010f06d3a91bdf4fee051.avif?t=1772218347 width=800 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Etiquette Elegance</strong> is a test of your memory and attentiveness, where every detail counts. Join us and discover the amazing world of true elegance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*The etiquette of this establishment is an art that exists by its own special rules. Any resemblance to real life is purely coincidental – don’t even think about trying this in a high-end restaurant!</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Etiquette Elegance</i> — a temple of refinement and impeccable service. Tailor the dishes to your guests' tastes, set the tables to perfection, and create an atmosphere of exquisite elegance. But beware: the slightest mistake and perfection will be lost. Can you achieve perfection and become a legend of the gastronomic club?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graceful table setting</strong> – Arrange the cutlery correctly, keep the table in order, and follow all the nuances of restaurant etiquette</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/extras/8cd78cee870aba341613306517cd4ca9.poster.avif?t=1772218347\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/extras/8cd78cee870aba341613306517cd4ca9.webm?t=1772218347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/extras/8cd78cee870aba341613306517cd4ca9.mp4?t=1772218347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absurdly picky guests</strong> – Each visitor has their own tastes, habits, and quirks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/extras/49a61607463f2188b29eff4509ba7c49.avif?t=1772218347\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/extras_big/49a61607463f2188b29eff4509ba7c49.avif?t=1772218347 width=800 height=125 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dishes beyond time and space</strong> – Over 50 menu items created from a variety of ingredients</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/extras/184984a70595ebf4663de0525370d19e.avif?t=1772218347\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/extras_big/184984a70595ebf4663de0525370d19e.avif?t=1772218347 width=800 height=125 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily chaos</strong> – Unexpected challenges make each level special</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/extras/d6ed70063e0dc640c180f715cde0c41c.avif?t=1772218347\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/extras_big/d6ed70063e0dc640c180f715cde0c41c.avif?t=1772218347 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylish retro-futuristic setting</strong> – Immerse yourself in the elegant atmosphere of a classic restaurant of the future</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/extras/972df50e44d010f06d3a91bdf4fee051.avif?t=1772218347\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538500/extras_big/972df50e44d010f06d3a91bdf4fee051.avif?t=1772218347 width=800 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Etiquette Elegance</strong> is a test of your memory and attentiveness, where every detail counts. Join us and discover the amazing world of true elegance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*The etiquette of this establishment is an art that exists by its own special rules. Any resemblance to real life is purely coincidental – don’t even think about trying this in a high-end restaurant!</i></p>",
